{"id":"n15826-1-7","stage":1,"title":"거리 · 距离","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15826-1-7-1","ko":"고향에는 자주 가는 편이에요?","zh":"你经常回老家吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고향에는","meaning":"故乡，家乡","explanation":"고향：故乡，家乡；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"1","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고향에는","audio":"/audio/7c7646eed58b1bd69df1.mp3"}},{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常。","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"가는","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가는","audio":"/audio/4df15b29e7ed7afe1cce.mp3"}},{"text":"편이에요?","meaning":"算是","explanation":"편：算是；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"편","audio":"/audio/53cb600fa1af07485c60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71321","senseId":"3","lemma":"편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편이에요","audio":"/audio/3620e22eab66acfded1f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家乡","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"出生成长的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]},{"id":"604b383d216f9452","term":"자주","zh":"常常，经常","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3","entryId":"71199","definition":"重复做同样事情的间隔短暂地。","pronunciation":["자주"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"53cb